{
  "_doc": "Kopfnoten (conduct, CAP-8). Values run 1-4 where 4 is best, stored fractionally and shown rounded; every kid starts at `start`. `events`: when `event` fires (payload.player, default 0) the category moves by `delta` through the kopfnoten.add action. `filter` must match payload fields exactly, `min` is a minimum per payload field. Events nobody emits yet simply never fire.",
  "categories": ["verhalten", "mitarbeit", "ordnung", "hilfsbereitschaft"],
